  "content": "\n\n<p><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a style=\"color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmenagerie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/996603/description_469c968d-9669-428f-afa4-ab7bc45b4605.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"141\"></a></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/996603/description_ea6454d4-588f-4425-be29-789417e7989f.png\" alt=\"\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/996603/description_d1e7d94c-d700-4b9b-a6cb-3007bd243a9b.png\" alt=\"\"></span></strong><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/996603/description_93a71c9f-a4b9-4c97-b126-c2394c92db5f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1000\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">感谢所有让 Menagerie 成为可能的人：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">资料来源于《国家地理》、BBC《野生动物杂志》、世界自然基金会（WWF）、维基百科</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">OutrightWings - 维护与技术支持，共同作者</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">OmayPaty - 任务奖励自定义模型</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">frogthejamunchained - 整合包协助与建议</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">codyhuh - 自定义模组 'spawnt'、自定义模组 'water breathe'、simplehats 数据包</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">_fingernails - 数据包和资源包协助</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">zephten - 整合包名称</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">所有 Menagerie 测试玩家</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">所有 Menagerie Discord 成员</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">资源/数据包列表：</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bat-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scutoel 制作的 Bat Backport</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/frozys-quest-book\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frozy 制作的 Frozy's Quest Book</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-xaeros\" rel=\"nofollow\">Icon - Xaero</a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/icon-xaeros\" rel=\"nofollow\">的 1.14 by godkyo98</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/serified-font\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serified Font 由&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/bebebea_loste\" rel=\"nofollow\">bebebea_loste</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soft-weather\" rel=\"nofollow\">vectorwing 制作的 Soft Weather</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffarmer-icons\" rel=\"nofollow\">MaTik 制作的 Farmer GUI</a></p>\n<p>在 Ko-Fi 上支持他们：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmatikk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/matikk</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark\" rel=\"nofollow\">amongstreality 制作的 Unique Dark</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; BuyMeACoffee：https: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.buymeacoffee.com/amongstreality</a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; Planet Minecraft：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252famongstreality%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/amongstreality/</a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; CurseForge：curseforge.com/members/amongstreality/projects<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; Modrinth：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/user/AmongstReality</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark-gui-modded-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlackAuresArt 制作的 Unique Dark Modded GUI Compat</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252fpicker%252fresource-packs%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">ZMenagerie Resources - 包含来自 VanillaTweaks 的功能，在此查看</span></a></p>\n<pre>Vanilla Tweaks：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://vanillatweaks.net/</a></pre>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><strong>模组列表：</strong></span></p>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Endergetic Expansion (by TeamAbnormals)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-nether-fortresses\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's Better Nether Fortresses (Forge/NeoForge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chunk-sending-forge-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunk Sending[Forge/Fabric] (by someaddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placebo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placebo (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fix-gpu-memory-leak\" rel=\"nofollow\">fix GPU memory leak[Forge/Fabric] (by someaddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-village-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Villages - Forge (by jtl_elisa)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Core (by P3pp3rF1y)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framedblocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fram